WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.600
[Adem gives Klippy access to his downloads,
images, videos and documents]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.900
[He adds a folder path and tells Klippy
that he likes cars]

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.300
[In the chat, Adem introduces himself]

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.300
[Klippy greets him by name]

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.800
[In a new chat, Adem types “I’d like
to see a picture of my new car”]

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.300
[Klippy finds a photo in an indexed folder
A red car appears in the reply]

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:40.100
[Adem opens the matching photo
from the file manager]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.400
[Back in the chat, he types a thank-you]
